# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value, then run `npm run build`.
#
# Web3Forms access key for the contact form (public by design — it ends up in
# the browser bundle, which is fine). Get a free key at https://web3forms.com by
# entering the recipient email (jan@kuijperskip.com); the key is emailed to you.
# Submissions then arrive at that address. No server or secret is required.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key
